-- Q9. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized due to my son biting me
-- in the ankle, proof of my wellness visit was provided 6 months after
-- the effective date, and I was serving as a police officer at the time
-- of hospitalization?
--
-- Judgement call (see NOTES.md): the bite has no causal nexus to police
-- service, so `causes` does not include `Police service` — merely being
-- on the force "at the time of hospitalization" does not, on its own,
-- mean the injury "arose ... out of" that service.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`             IS 7
    `hospitalization ground`            IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`            IS 40
    `causes`                            IS LIST Other
    `fraud month`                       IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`           IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`              IS JUST 1
    `wellness visit provider qualified` IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`        IS JUST 6
    `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`    IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`      IS JUST 0
    `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                IS 12

#EVAL covered q9
